     A* WORKERS' COMP BILLING INFORMATION HOLDING FILE
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  150WCS       PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  06/19/18                                           *
     A*  PURPOSE:  THIS FILE HOLDS INFORMATION THAT THE BILLS         *
     A*            DETERMINE BY READING ALL DIVISIONS.  THIS FILE     *
     A*            WILL ALLOW INFORMATION TO BE DETERMINED ONCE       *
     A*            AND THEN REUSED.                                   *
     A*  CALCULATION TYPES:                                           *
     A*  A - ACTUAL PREMIUM AND NET RATE                              *
     A*  D - STOCK DISCOUNT                                           *
     A*  E - EXPENSE CONSTANT                                         *
     A*  G - GOVERNING CLASS                                          *
     A*  M - INCR LIMITS AND REGULAR MINIMUM                          *
     A*  N - NJ MINIMUM                                               *
     A*  P - STOCK DISCOUNT PREMIUM                                   *
     A*  R - NET RATE CALC                                            *
     A*  S - STANDARD PREMIUM                                         *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
